<urn:fair-dama-fairmm:alignment:ontology:core> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:description "DAMA ontologies v1.1.0 / document v1.18.0 / workbook V3 (2026-11-16). User-supplied local release; FAIR-DAMA checkout revision is context only, not provenance for the supplied release.",
        "Independent local ontology. Source definitions, proposed alignments and materialized associations remain distinct. No operational maturity assessment." ;
